18:["$","$L12",null,{"id":"chamber","data":{"title":"下界组件如何影响求解与证明","source":"可交换腔体研究稿，Table 7（§6.3.1，2026-09-07 核对）。","protocol":"25 个单构建单元算例，每个 n∈{10,15,20,25,30} 各 5 例。五种配置采用相同初始解与搜索规则，串行、单线程，限时 1200 秒；平均时间包含超时并按 1200 秒计。RBC-S 的每次调用预算为 0.05 秒、总预算为 5 秒。与 3600 秒的并行 LBBD 实验分别统计。","takeaway":"完整 BB 在 25 例中证明 24 例最优。n=30 的部分配置获得相同目标值，却没有完成最优性证明；“解值相同”和“已证明最优”需要分开看。","metrics":["$1:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:3:props:data:metrics:1",{"label":"已证明全局最优","unit":"例","direction":"越多越好","decimals":0}],"groups":[{"label":"全部 · 25 例","rows":[{"name":"BB-Base","values":[220.41,22]},{"name":"BB-RBC","values":[107.61,23]},{"name":"BB-RBC-S","values":[105.63,23]},{"name":"BB-HTC","values":[213.28,22]},{"name":"完整 BB","values":[101.31,24],"featured":true}]},{"label":"n=25 · 5 例","rows":[{"name":"BB-Base","values":[245.53,5]},{"name":"BB-RBC","values":[10.53,5]},{"name":"BB-RBC-S","values":[5.24,5]},{"name":"BB-HTC","values":[208.78,5]},{"name":"完整 BB","values":[2.86,5],"featured":true}]},{"label":"n=30 · 5 例","rows":[{"name":"BB-Base","values":[843.43,2]},{"name":"BB-RBC","values":[526.25,3]},{"name":"BB-RBC-S","values":[521.93,3]},{"name":"BB-HTC","values":[845.95,2]},{"name":"完整 BB","values":[503,4],"featured":true}]}]},"title":"$undefined","children":false}]
